OL,3,GNEWSAData centre developers may build
OL,4,A'climate-wrecking' gas power plant next
OL,5,Adoor
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe developer of a proposed data centre
OL,8,Fin Cardiff has said it is also seeking
OL,9,Fpermission to build a gas power plant
OL,10,Fto get it up and running.
OL,12,FDeveloper Curtis Hall said the plant,
OL,13,Fwhich could operate for up to five
OL,14,Fyears, may be needed if the site cannot
OL,15,Fget on the national grid quick enough.
OL,17,FIt also said the gas turbine plan was a
OL,18,F"worst-case scenario", and the project
OL,19,F- planned for the site of an existing
OL,20,Fpark and ride near Llanrumney - would
OL,21,Fbring significant benefits.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
