OL,3,GNEWSAData centre developers may build
OL,4,A'climate-wrecking' gas power plant next
OL,5,Adoor
OL,6,
OL,7,FFriends of the Earth called it
OL,8,F"climate-wrecking" infrastructure, and
OL,9,Falmost all the area's Members of the
OL,10,FSenedd (MSs), and a Welsh government
OL,11,Fminister, have now formally objected to
OL,12,Fthe plans to build the data centre.
